{
  "id": "geophysics_normal_gravity",
  "version": 1,
  "execution": {
    "python": "calculate_normal_gravity / remove_normal_gravity",
    "javascript": "descriptor and correction-ledger replay only",
    "install": "pip install baselode[gravity]"
  },
  "models": {
    "WGS84": {
      "model": "WGS84",
      "backend": "boule",
      "backend_version": "0.6.0",
      "algorithm": "external_normal_gravity_full_gradient",
      "coordinate_system": "geodetic",
      "units": "mGal",
      "semimajor_axis": 6378137,
      "flattening": 0.0033528106647474805,
      "geocentric_grav_const": 398600441800000.0,
      "angular_velocity": 7.292115e-05
    },
    "GRS80": {
      "model": "GRS80",
      "backend": "boule",
      "backend_version": "0.6.0",
      "algorithm": "external_normal_gravity_full_gradient",
      "coordinate_system": "geodetic",
      "units": "mGal",
      "semimajor_axis": 6378137,
      "flattening": 0.003352810681182319,
      "geocentric_grav_const": 398600500000000.0,
      "angular_velocity": 7.292115e-05
    }
  },
  "request_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "model",
      "points"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "model": {
        "enum": [
          "WGS84",
          "GRS80"
        ]
      },
      "points": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 512,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "id",
            "longitude",
            "latitude",
            "height_m"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            },
            "longitude": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -180,
              "maximum": 180
            },
            "latitude": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -90,
              "maximum": 90
            },
            "height_m": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -1000,
              "maximum": 100000
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "height_policy": {
        "enum": [
          "external_only",
          "analytic_continuation"
        ],
        "default": "external_only"
      }
    }
  },
  "result_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "schema",
      "version",
      "state",
      "issues",
      "model",
      "fields",
      "producer",
      "assumptions"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "schema": {
        "const": "baselode.geophysics.normal_gravity"
      },
      "version": {
        "const": 1
      },
      "state": {
        "enum": [
          "ok",
          "needs_input",
          "rejected",
          "failed"
        ]
      },
      "issues": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "code",
            "message"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "code": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "model": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": {
              "model": "WGS84",
              "backend": "boule",
              "backend_version": "0.6.0",
              "algorithm": "external_normal_gravity_full_gradient",
              "coordinate_system": "geodetic",
              "units": "mGal",
              "semimajor_axis": 6378137,
              "flattening": 0.0033528106647474805,
              "geocentric_grav_const": 398600441800000.0,
              "angular_velocity": 7.292115e-05
            }
          },
          {
            "const": {
              "model": "GRS80",
              "backend": "boule",
              "backend_version": "0.6.0",
              "algorithm": "external_normal_gravity_full_gradient",
              "coordinate_system": "geodetic",
              "units": "mGal",
              "semimajor_axis": 6378137,
              "flattening": 0.003352810681182319,
              "geocentric_grav_const": 398600500000000.0,
              "angular_velocity": 7.292115e-05
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ]
      },
      "fields": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 512,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "id",
            "normal_gravity",
            "height_sensitivity_mGal_per_m",
            "ellipsoidal_u_component_mGal",
            "ellipsoidal_beta_component_mGal",
            "height_extrapolated"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            },
            "normal_gravity": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -1e+100,
              "maximum": 1e+100
            },
            "height_sensitivity_mGal_per_m": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -1e+100,
              "maximum": 1e+100
            },
            "ellipsoidal_u_component_mGal": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -1e+100,
              "maximum": 1e+100
            },
            "ellipsoidal_beta_component_mGal": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": -1e+100,
              "maximum": 1e+100
            },
            "height_extrapolated": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "producer": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "library",
          "version",
          "algorithm_version"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "library": {
            "const": "baselode"
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128
          },
          "algorithm_version": {
            "const": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "assumptions": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "removal_parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "channel",
      "model",
      "reference_policy",
      "event_id",
      "evidence"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "channel": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]{0,63}$"
      },
      "model": {
        "enum": [
          "WGS84",
          "GRS80"
        ]
      },
      "reference_policy": {
        "const": "caller_verified"
      },
      "event_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 128
      },
      "evidence": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 4096
      },
      "height_policy": {
        "enum": [
          "external_only",
          "analytic_continuation"
        ],
        "default": "external_only"
      }
    }
  },
  "resources": {
    "max_points": 512,
    "max_height_m": 100000,
    "sensitivity_step_m": 1,
    "min_continued_height_m": -1000
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "Normal gravity is the magnitude of gravitational plus centrifugal acceleration of the selected rotating reference ellipsoid at geodetic latitude and ellipsoidal height, using Boule 0.6.0 for the ellipsoidal u-component plus the analytic beta derivative of the normal potential. Their orthogonal norm is the full magnitude; no constant free-air approximation.",
    "Longitude/latitude in degrees, ellipsoidal height in metres, normal gravity in mGal. Default height_policy=external_only accepts 0..100000 m, poles included. Explicit height_policy=analytic_continuation also allows -1000..0 m with per-point height_extrapolated=true. This continues the external normal potential mathematically; it is not an interior-density/mass model. No geoid/datum conversion.",
    "Height sensitivity is the explicitly labelled forward finite difference gamma(h+1 m)-gamma(h), mGal/m; backend evaluation reaches 100001 m at the workload boundary. It is sensitivity, not propagated uncertainty.",
    "WGS84 removal requires EPSG:4326 and WGS84_ellipsoid height datum. GRS80 requires EPSG:4283/7844 and GRS80_ellipsoid. degree/degrees, height_units=m and z_positive=up are mandatory. Horizontal reprojection follows its own supported-CRS contract.",
    "Removal requires positive calibrated absolute gravity_observed/mGal, not relative/dial readings, and known unapplied gravity_normal, gravity_free_air, gravity_bouguer and gravity_terrain history for the selected channel. Declare histories from source evidence; none are inferred. Drift/tide states survive and are not claimed corrected.",
    "Require declared non-unknown gravity_datum and tide_system=tide_free/zero_tide/mean_tide, plus reference_policy=caller_verified. Caller verifies comparability to the selected normal model; the adapter performs no absolute-gravity-datum or permanent-tide-system transformation.",
    "Subtract observed minus normal gravity at the same location/height; label gravity_disturbance, distinct from a classical reduced gravity anomaly. Missing selected readings are retained; every nonnull selected reading needs complete context before one atomic application.",
    "Strict model/context/data bindings, existing ledger state/ID/count checks and standard source lineage protect replay. History guards detect accidental edits, not deliberate authenticated rewriting. Uncertainty fields are archived, not propagated."
  ],
  "references": [
    "https://www.fatiando.org/boule/latest/api/generated/boule.Ellipsoid.html",
    "https://www.fatiando.org/boule/latest/user_guide/gravity_disturbance.html",
    "https://www.ngs.noaa.gov/grav-d/data/NGS_GRAV-D_General_Airborne_Gravity_Data_User_Manual_v1.1.pdf"
  ]
}
